OL,3,GNEWSA'Young people should report
OL,4,Aworries about knives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaigner whose teenage son was
OL,7,Ffatally stabbed has urged young people
OL,8,Fto speak up if they have concerns about
OL,9,Fknife crime.
OL,11,FMartin Cosser, whose 17-year-old son
OL,12,FCharlie was killed at a party in West
OL,13,FSussex, made the comment as he launched
OL,14,Fa film to raise awareness about the
OL,15,Fyouth service Fearless.
OL,17,FHe said the service, run by the charity
OL,18,FCrimestoppers, allowed information
OL,19,Fabout crime to be reported anonymously.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
