OL,3,GNEWSA'Young people should report
OL,4,Aworries about knives'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Young people fear telling parents
OL,7,F[their concerns around people carrying
OL,8,Fknives] because they don't want to
OL,9,Fworry them," Cosser, from Surrey, told
OL,10,Fthe BBC.
